00:02:45,877 --> 00:02:48,938
of course we have a list of data because we

65
00:02:48,938 --> 00:02:51,902
don't need to give every item a unique ID.

66
00:02:52,206 --> 00:02:54,914
We just go through that list step by step

67
00:02:54,994 --> 00:02:57,702
and check all the items off the list which

68
00:02:57,895 --> 00:02:58,696
